[2026-03-14T20:56:55.611Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01APKfpic7rdpV7eEHiTedxh","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me create a comprehensive summary document with all the findings:\n\n## Comprehensive Exploration of AirbnbClone App\n\nI've completed a thorough exploration of the airbnb-clone app. Here's a complete breakdown of all the information you requested:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **App Directory Structure**\n\n**Main Directory:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/`\n\n**Key Subdirectories:**\n- **src/** - Application source code\n  - `components/` - 33 React components (including BookingsTab.tsx)\n  - `pages/` - 7 page components (HostDashboard.tsx, Home, Login, MyTrips, Profile, PropertyDetail, WriteReview)\n  - `slices/` - 9 Redux slices (hostSlice.ts, authSlice, bookingsSlice, propertiesSlice, etc.)\n  - `store.ts` - Redux store configuration\n  - `App.tsx` - Main app component\n  - `main.tsx` - React entry point\n  - `index.css` - Global styles\n\n- **netlify/functions/** - 12 serverless Netlify functions\n  - `bookings.ts`, `host-bookings.ts`, `host-stats.ts` - Booking-related endpoints\n  - `auth.ts`, `users.ts` - Authentication/user endpoints\n  - `properties.ts`, `property-images.ts` - Property endpoints\n  - `reviews.ts`, `amenities.ts`, `favorites.ts` - Other resource endpoints\n  - `db.ts` - Database connection module\n\n- **tests/** - 19 Playwright test files (existing host dashboard tests)\n- **docs/** - `tests.md` (comprehensive 1000+ line test specification document)\n- **scripts/** - Database seeding, checking, testing, deployment scripts\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Bookings Tab Tests Specification** (from docs/tests.md)\n\nThe **BookingsTab** component testing section starts at **line 847** in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`. Key test requirements:\n\n**Core Functionality Tests:**\n- ✓ Bookings tab displays table of bookings for host's properties (columns: Property, Guest, Check-in, Check-out, Guests, Total, Status, Actions)\n- ✓ Bookings table shows correct data for each booking (with formatted dates, currency, status badges)\n- ✓ Status filter controls visible (\"All\", \"Pending\", \"Confirmed\", \"Cancelled\", \"Completed\")\n- ✓ Each status filter works independently\n- ✓ Resetting filter to \"All\" shows all bookings\n- ✓ Status filters work on repeated use\n\n**Action Tests:**\n- ✓ Host can confirm a pending booking (status changes, buttons update, stats updated)\n- ✓ Host can cancel a pending or confirmed booking (with confirmation dialog)\n- ✓ Completed and cancelled bookings have NO action buttons\n- ✓ Confirm and cancel actions work on repeated use\n\n**UI Tests:**\n- ✓ Empty state shown when no bookings exist\n- ✓ Status badges display correct colors (pending=yellow, confirmed=green, cancelled=red, completed=blue)\n- ✓ Confirmation dialog shows booking details (property, guest, dates)\n\n---\n\n### 3. **Seed Data Related to Bookings**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` (lines 290-299)\n\n**Seeded Bookings:**\n1. **e1111111** - Loft property (Sarah's), Emma guest, Dec 15-20 2025, 2 guests, $825, **completed**, \"Late check-in\"\n2. **e2222222** - Villa property (Sarah's), Alex guest, Apr 1-7 2026, 6 guests, $2850, **confirmed**\n3. **e3333333** - Cabin property (Mike's), Emma guest, May 10-13 2026, 2 guests, $650, **pending**, \"Celebrating anniversary\"\n4. **e4444444** - Austin Apt (Mike's), Alex guest, Nov 1-5 2025, 1 guest, $520, **completed**\n5. **e5555555** - Loft (Sarah's), Alex guest, Oct 20-22 2025, 2 guests, $375, **cancelled**\n6. **e6666666** - Townhouse (Sarah's), Emma guest, Jun 15-20 2026, 4 guests, $1475, **confirmed**, \"Need parking\"\n\n**Seed Users (for hosts):**\n- Sarah Chen (a1111111) - host with 3 properties (Loft, Villa, Townhouse)\n- Mike Johnson (a2222222) - host with 2 properties (Cabin, Austin Apt)\n- Emma Wilson (a3333333) - non-host guest\n- Alex Rivera (a4444444) - non-host guest\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Netlify Function: host-bookings.ts**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/host-bookings.ts`\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/host-bookings?host_id={hostId}`\n\n**Functionality:**\n- Retrieves all bookings for a host's properties (not direct guest bookings)\n- **SQL Query joins:** bookings → properties → users\n- **Returns:** Array of HostBooking objects with enriched data:\n  - Booking fields: `id, property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price, status, special_requests, created_at`\n  - Enriched fields: `property_title, property_city, property_country, property_image, guest_name, guest_email`\n- **Ordering:** By created_at DESC (newest first)\n- **Error handling:** Returns 400 if host_id missing, 405 for unsupported methods\n\n**Method:** GET only\n\n---\n\n### 5. **Host Dashboard Page & BookingsTab Component**\n\n**Host Dashboard Page:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/HostDashboard.tsx`\n\n**Structure:**\n- Tab-based layout (Listings | Bookings)\n- Renders `StatsOverview`, `ListingsTab`, `BookingsTab`, `AddListingForm`\n- Auth required: redirects to /login if not logged in\n- Host check: shows \"Become a Host\" prompt if user.is_host = false\n- Redux integration: dispatches `fetchHostStats`, `fetchHostListings`, `fetchHostBookings`\n- Handlers: `handleConfirmBooking`, `handleCancelBooking` dispatch `updateHostBookingStatus` thunk\n\n**BookingsTab Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx` (207 lines)\n\n**Features:**\n- **Status Filters:** Buttons for \"All\", \"Pending\", \"Confirmed\", \"Cancelled\", \"Completed\"\n- **Table Columns:** Property, Guest, Check-in, Check-out, Guests, Total, Status, Actions\n- **Date Formatting:** Uses custom `formatDate()` function (formatted as \"Jan 1, 2026\")\n- **Status Colors:** Using `statusColors` object mapping (pending/confirmed/cancelled/completed)\n- **Action Buttons:**\n  - Pending bookings: Show \"Confirm\" and \"Cancel\" buttons\n  - Confirmed bookings: Show \"Cancel\" button only\n  - Completed/Cancelled: No action buttons\n- **Confirmation Dialog:** Modal for cancelling bookings with property/guest/dates context\n- **Loading States:** Button disabled states and loading indicators during async operations\n- **Empty State:** Shows Calendar icon with message when no bookings\n\n**Test IDs Used:**\n- `bookings-tab`, `bookings-table`, `bookings-empty-state`\n- `booking-filter-{status}`, `booking-row-{id}`\n- `booking-status-{id}`, `booking-confirm-{id}`, `booking-cancel-{id}`\n- `cancel-booking-dialog`, `cancel-booking-dialog-confirm`, `cancel-booking-dialog-dismiss`\n\n---\n\n### 6. **Playwright Configuration**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n**Key Settings:**\n- **Test Directory:** `./tests`\n- **Base URL:** `http://localhost:8888`\n- **Timeout:** 60 seconds\n- **Expect Timeout:** 10 seconds\n- **Workers:** 1 (sequential, not parallel)\n- **Retries:** 0\n- **Parallel:** false (forbidOnly: true)\n- **Reporters:** \n  - Replay reporter (with upload: false)\n  - JSON results (`test-results/results.json`)\n  - HTML report (never opens)\n- **Web Server:** Netlify dev on port 8888\n  - Command: `npx netlify dev --port 8888 --functions ./netlify/functions`\n  - Timeout: 30s\n  - Reuse existing server: true\n- **Device:** Replay Chromium\n- **Trace:** on-first-retry\n- **Action Timeout:** 15 seconds\n\n---\n\n### 7. **Existing Host Dashboard Test Files**\n\n**File 1:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/host-dashboard-auth-stats.spec.ts` (129 lines)\n\nTests:\n1. ✓ Requires login (redirects to /login)\n2. ✓ Requires host status (shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts)\n3. ✓ Stats displays total listings count (Sarah = 3)\n4. ✓ Stats displays active bookings (Sarah = 2)\n5. ✓ Stats displays total earnings (Sarah = $825)\n6. ✓ Stats displays average rating (Sarah = 5.0)\n7. ✓ Stats shows zeros for new host with no data\n8. ✓ Navigation tabs visible (Listings, Bookings)\n9. ✓ Switching between tabs works\n\n**File 2:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/host-dashboard-listings.spec.ts` (194 lines)\n\nTests:\n1. ✓ Listings grid displays properties\n2. ✓ Listing card shows details\n3. ✓ Edit button navigates to property detail\n4. ✓ Deactivate button opens confirmation dialog\n5. ✓ Confirming deactivation updates status and stats\n6. ✓ Dismissing dialog keeps property active\n7. ✓ Activate button for inactive properties\n8. ✓ Empty state for host with no properties\n9. ✓ Add Listing button visible\n10. ✓ Deactivate and activate work on repeated use\n\n**Helper Function:** `loginAsHost()`, `goToHostDashboard()`\n\n**Test Pattern:** Uses Playwright's `page.getByTestId()`, `expect()`, timeouts of 30s for navigation, 15s for content\n\n---\n\n### 8. **db.ts Module (Netlify Functions)**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/db.ts` (6 lines)\n\n**Function:** `getSql()`\n\n**Implementation:**\n```typescript\nimport { neon } from '@neondatabase/serverless'\n\nexport function getSql() {\n  return neon(process.env.DATABASE_URL!)\n}\n```\n\n**Purpose:**\n- Exports a function that returns a Neon SQL client\n- Uses environment variable `DATABASE_URL`\n- Used by all Netlify functions for database queries\n- Returns the neon client instance configured for serverless PostgreSQL\n\n---\n\n### 9. **Redux Integration for Bookings**\n\n**hostSlice.ts** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/hostSlice.ts` - 268 lines)\n\n**HostBooking Interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface HostBooking {\n  id: string\n  property_id: string\n  guest_id: string\n  check_in: string\n  check_out: string\n  num_guests: number\n  total_price: number\n  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n  special_requests: string | null\n  created_at: string\n  property_title?: string\n  property_city?: string\n  property_country?: string\n  property_image?: string | null\n  guest_name?: string\n  guest_email?: string\n}\n```\n\n**Key Async Thunks:**\n- `fetchHostBookings(hostId)` - GET `/api/host-bookings?host_id={hostId}`\n- `updateHostBookingStatus({ bookingId, status })` - PUT `/api/bookings/{bookingId}` with status\n\n**State Management:**\n- `bookings: HostBooking[]` - Array of bookings\n- `bookingsLoading: boolean` - Loading state\n- `stats: HostStats` - Updated when booking status changes (active bookings count)\n\n**Reducer Logic for updateHostBookingStatus:**\n- Updates booking status in state\n- Adjusts `activeBookings` count when status changes (pending/confirmed = active)\n- Handles status transitions correctly\n\n---\n\n### 10. **Comprehensive Component Dependencies**\n\n**BookingsTab Component Dependencies:**\n- Lucide React: `Loader2`, `Calendar` icons\n- Redux: HostBooking type from hostSlice\n- React: `useState` hook\n\n**HostDashboard Dependencies:**\n- Redux: useSelector, useDispatch\n- React Router: useNavigate\n- Redux Thunks: fetchHostStats, fetchHostListings, fetchHostBookings, updateHostBookingStatus, deactivateProperty, activateProperty\n- Child Components: StatsOverview, ListingsTab, BookingsTab, AddListingForm\n\n---\n\n### Summary Statistics\n\n- **Total Components:** 33 in components/ directory\n- **Total Pages:** 7 in pages/ directory\n- **Total Netlify Functions:** 12\n- **Total Redux Slices:** 9\n- **Total Test Files:** 19 Playwright spec files\n- **Existing Host Dashboard Tests:** 2 files (auth-stats, listings)\n- **Test Specification Doc:** 1000+ lines in docs/tests.md\n- **Seed Bookings:** 6 bookings with various statuses\n- **Seed Hosts:** 2 hosts (Sarah, Mike) with 5 total properties\n\nThis provides a complete foundation for understanding the bookings tab requirements, existing test patterns, and the infrastructure needed for implementing comprehensive bookings tab tests for the host dashboard."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a7be75ad5cc8627d7 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 75882\ntool_uses: 30\nduration_ms: 63979</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b1ebe240-ab8e-4ccc-a035-25792ffc73c0","uuid":"8b5944f1-3214-402c-aa5d-6e08bdc816f5","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the airbnb-clone app in /repo/apps/. I need to understand:\n1. The app directory structure (ls the app dir and key subdirs)\n2. The docs/tests.md file - specifically the section about bookings tab tests for the host dashboard\n3. The seed data related to bookings\n4. The existing Netlify functions for bookings (read the bookings function)\n5. The host dashboard page component and any bookings tab component\n6. The playwright config\n7. Any existing test files (especially host dashboard tests)\n8. The db.ts module in netlify/functions\n\nBe thorough - read all relevant component source files for the bookings tab.","agentId":"a7be75ad5cc8627d7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me create a comprehensive summary document with all the findings:\n\n## Comprehensive Exploration of AirbnbClone App\n\nI've completed a thorough exploration of the airbnb-clone app. Here's a complete breakdown of all the information you requested:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **App Directory Structure**\n\n**Main Directory:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/`\n\n**Key Subdirectories:**\n- **src/** - Application source code\n  - `components/` - 33 React components (including BookingsTab.tsx)\n  - `pages/` - 7 page components (HostDashboard.tsx, Home, Login, MyTrips, Profile, PropertyDetail, WriteReview)\n  - `slices/` - 9 Redux slices (hostSlice.ts, authSlice, bookingsSlice, propertiesSlice, etc.)\n  - `store.ts` - Redux store configuration\n  - `App.tsx` - Main app component\n  - `main.tsx` - React entry point\n  - `index.css` - Global styles\n\n- **netlify/functions/** - 12 serverless Netlify functions\n  - `bookings.ts`, `host-bookings.ts`, `host-stats.ts` - Booking-related endpoints\n  - `auth.ts`, `users.ts` - Authentication/user endpoints\n  - `properties.ts`, `property-images.ts` - Property endpoints\n  - `reviews.ts`, `amenities.ts`, `favorites.ts` - Other resource endpoints\n  - `db.ts` - Database connection module\n\n- **tests/** - 19 Playwright test files (existing host dashboard tests)\n- **docs/** - `tests.md` (comprehensive 1000+ line test specification document)\n- **scripts/** - Database seeding, checking, testing, deployment scripts\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Bookings Tab Tests Specification** (from docs/tests.md)\n\nThe **BookingsTab** component testing section starts at **line 847** in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`. Key test requirements:\n\n**Core Functionality Tests:**\n- ✓ Bookings tab displays table of bookings for host's properties (columns: Property, Guest, Check-in, Check-out, Guests, Total, Status, Actions)\n- ✓ Bookings table shows correct data for each booking (with formatted dates, currency, status badges)\n- ✓ Status filter controls visible (\"All\", \"Pending\", \"Confirmed\", \"Cancelled\", \"Completed\")\n- ✓ Each status filter works independently\n- ✓ Resetting filter to \"All\" shows all bookings\n- ✓ Status filters work on repeated use\n\n**Action Tests:**\n- ✓ Host can confirm a pending booking (status changes, buttons update, stats updated)\n- ✓ Host can cancel a pending or confirmed booking (with confirmation dialog)\n- ✓ Completed and cancelled bookings have NO action buttons\n- ✓ Confirm and cancel actions work on repeated use\n\n**UI Tests:**\n- ✓ Empty state shown when no bookings exist\n- ✓ Status badges display correct colors (pending=yellow, confirmed=green, cancelled=red, completed=blue)\n- ✓ Confirmation dialog shows booking details (property, guest, dates)\n\n---\n\n### 3. **Seed Data Related to Bookings**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` (lines 290-299)\n\n**Seeded Bookings:**\n1. **e1111111** - Loft property (Sarah's), Emma guest, Dec 15-20 2025, 2 guests, $825, **completed**, \"Late check-in\"\n2. **e2222222** - Villa property (Sarah's), Alex guest, Apr 1-7 2026, 6 guests, $2850, **confirmed**\n3. **e3333333** - Cabin property (Mike's), Emma guest, May 10-13 2026, 2 guests, $650, **pending**, \"Celebrating anniversary\"\n4. **e4444444** - Austin Apt (Mike's), Alex guest, Nov 1-5 2025, 1 guest, $520, **completed**\n5. **e5555555** - Loft (Sarah's), Alex guest, Oct 20-22 2025, 2 guests, $375, **cancelled**\n6. **e6666666** - Townhouse (Sarah's), Emma guest, Jun 15-20 2026, 4 guests, $1475, **confirmed**, \"Need parking\"\n\n**Seed Users (for hosts):**\n- Sarah Chen (a1111111) - host with 3 properties (Loft, Villa, Townhouse)\n- Mike Johnson (a2222222) - host with 2 properties (Cabin, Austin Apt)\n- Emma Wilson (a3333333) - non-host guest\n- Alex Rivera (a4444444) - non-host guest\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Netlify Function: host-bookings.ts**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/host-bookings.ts`\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/host-bookings?host_id={hostId}`\n\n**Functionality:**\n- Retrieves all bookings for a host's properties (not direct guest bookings)\n- **SQL Query joins:** bookings → properties → users\n- **Returns:** Array of HostBooking objects with enriched data:\n  - Booking fields: `id, property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price, status, special_requests, created_at`\n  - Enriched fields: `property_title, property_city, property_country, property_image, guest_name, guest_email`\n- **Ordering:** By created_at DESC (newest first)\n- **Error handling:** Returns 400 if host_id missing, 405 for unsupported methods\n\n**Method:** GET only\n\n---\n\n### 5. **Host Dashboard Page & BookingsTab Component**\n\n**Host Dashboard Page:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/HostDashboard.tsx`\n\n**Structure:**\n- Tab-based layout (Listings | Bookings)\n- Renders `StatsOverview`, `ListingsTab`, `BookingsTab`, `AddListingForm`\n- Auth required: redirects to /login if not logged in\n- Host check: shows \"Become a Host\" prompt if user.is_host = false\n- Redux integration: dispatches `fetchHostStats`, `fetchHostListings`, `fetchHostBookings`\n- Handlers: `handleConfirmBooking`, `handleCancelBooking` dispatch `updateHostBookingStatus` thunk\n\n**BookingsTab Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx` (207 lines)\n\n**Features:**\n- **Status Filters:** Buttons for \"All\", \"Pending\", \"Confirmed\", \"Cancelled\", \"Completed\"\n- **Table Columns:** Property, Guest, Check-in, Check-out, Guests, Total, Status, Actions\n- **Date Formatting:** Uses custom `formatDate()` function (formatted as \"Jan 1, 2026\")\n- **Status Colors:** Using `statusColors` object mapping (pending/confirmed/cancelled/completed)\n- **Action Buttons:**\n  - Pending bookings: Show \"Confirm\" and \"Cancel\" buttons\n  - Confirmed bookings: Show \"Cancel\" button only\n  - Completed/Cancelled: No action buttons\n- **Confirmation Dialog:** Modal for cancelling bookings with property/guest/dates context\n- **Loading States:** Button disabled states and loading indicators during async operations\n- **Empty State:** Shows Calendar icon with message when no bookings\n\n**Test IDs Used:**\n- `bookings-tab`, `bookings-table`, `bookings-empty-state`\n- `booking-filter-{status}`, `booking-row-{id}`\n- `booking-status-{id}`, `booking-confirm-{id}`, `booking-cancel-{id}`\n- `cancel-booking-dialog`, `cancel-booking-dialog-confirm`, `cancel-booking-dialog-dismiss`\n\n---\n\n### 6. **Playwright Configuration**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n**Key Settings:**\n- **Test Directory:** `./tests`\n- **Base URL:** `http://localhost:8888`\n- **Timeout:** 60 seconds\n- **Expect Timeout:** 10 seconds\n- **Workers:** 1 (sequential, not parallel)\n- **Retries:** 0\n- **Parallel:** false (forbidOnly: true)\n- **Reporters:** \n  - Replay reporter (with upload: false)\n  - JSON results (`test-results/results.json`)\n  - HTML report (never opens)\n- **Web Server:** Netlify dev on port 8888\n  - Command: `npx netlify dev --port 8888 --functions ./netlify/functions`\n  - Timeout: 30s\n  - Reuse existing server: true\n- **Device:** Replay Chromium\n- **Trace:** on-first-retry\n- **Action Timeout:** 15 seconds\n\n---\n\n### 7. **Existing Host Dashboard Test Files**\n\n**File 1:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/host-dashboard-auth-stats.spec.ts` (129 lines)\n\nTests:\n1. ✓ Requires login (redirects to /login)\n2. ✓ Requires host status (shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts)\n3. ✓ Stats displays total listings count (Sarah = 3)\n4. ✓ Stats displays active bookings (Sarah = 2)\n5. ✓ Stats displays total earnings (Sarah = $825)\n6. ✓ Stats displays average rating (Sarah = 5.0)\n7. ✓ Stats shows zeros for new host with no data\n8. ✓ Navigation tabs visible (Listings, Bookings)\n9. ✓ Switching between tabs works\n\n**File 2:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/host-dashboard-listings.spec.ts` (194 lines)\n\nTests:\n1. ✓ Listings grid displays properties\n2. ✓ Listing card shows details\n3. ✓ Edit button navigates to property detail\n4. ✓ Deactivate button opens confirmation dialog\n5. ✓ Confirming deactivation updates status and stats\n6. ✓ Dismissing dialog keeps property active\n7. ✓ Activate button for inactive properties\n8. ✓ Empty state for host with no properties\n9. ✓ Add Listing button visible\n10. ✓ Deactivate and activate work on repeated use\n\n**Helper Function:** `loginAsHost()`, `goToHostDashboard()`\n\n**Test Pattern:** Uses Playwright's `page.getByTestId()`, `expect()`, timeouts of 30s for navigation, 15s for content\n\n---\n\n### 8. **db.ts Module (Netlify Functions)**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/db.ts` (6 lines)\n\n**Function:** `getSql()`\n\n**Implementation:**\n```typescript\nimport { neon } from '@neondatabase/serverless'\n\nexport function getSql() {\n  return neon(process.env.DATABASE_URL!)\n}\n```\n\n**Purpose:**\n- Exports a function that returns a Neon SQL client\n- Uses environment variable `DATABASE_URL`\n- Used by all Netlify functions for database queries\n- Returns the neon client instance configured for serverless PostgreSQL\n\n---\n\n### 9. **Redux Integration for Bookings**\n\n**hostSlice.ts** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/hostSlice.ts` - 268 lines)\n\n**HostBooking Interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface HostBooking {\n  id: string\n  property_id: string\n  guest_id: string\n  check_in: string\n  check_out: string\n  num_guests: number\n  total_price: number\n  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n  special_requests: string | null\n  created_at: string\n  property_title?: string\n  property_city?: string\n  property_country?: string\n  property_image?: string | null\n  guest_name?: string\n  guest_email?: string\n}\n```\n\n**Key Async Thunks:**\n- `fetchHostBookings(hostId)` - GET `/api/host-bookings?host_id={hostId}`\n- `updateHostBookingStatus({ bookingId, status })` - PUT `/api/bookings/{bookingId}` with status\n\n**State Management:**\n- `bookings: HostBooking[]` - Array of bookings\n- `bookingsLoading: boolean` - Loading state\n- `stats: HostStats` - Updated when booking status changes (active bookings count)\n\n**Reducer Logic for updateHostBookingStatus:**\n- Updates booking status in state\n- Adjusts `activeBookings` count when status changes (pending/confirmed = active)\n- Handles status transitions correctly\n\n---\n\n### 10. **Comprehensive Component Dependencies**\n\n**BookingsTab Component Dependencies:**\n- Lucide React: `Loader2`, `Calendar` icons\n- Redux: HostBooking type from hostSlice\n- React: `useState` hook\n\n**HostDashboard Dependencies:**\n- Redux: useSelector, useDispatch\n- React Router: useNavigate\n- Redux Thunks: fetchHostStats, fetchHostListings, fetchHostBookings, updateHostBookingStatus, deactivateProperty, activateProperty\n- Child Components: StatsOverview, ListingsTab, BookingsTab, AddListingForm\n\n---\n\n### Summary Statistics\n\n- **Total Components:** 33 in components/ directory\n- **Total Pages:** 7 in pages/ directory\n- **Total Netlify Functions:** 12\n- **Total Redux Slices:** 9\n- **Total Test Files:** 19 Playwright spec files\n- **Existing Host Dashboard Tests:** 2 files (auth-stats, listings)\n- **Test Specification Doc:** 1000+ lines in docs/tests.md\n- **Seed Bookings:** 6 bookings with various statuses\n- **Seed Hosts:** 2 hosts (Sarah, Mike) with 5 total properties\n\nThis provides a complete foundation for understanding the bookings tab requirements, existing test patterns, and the infrastructure needed for implementing comprehensive bookings tab tests for the host dashboard."}],"totalDurationMs":63979,"totalTokens":75882,"totalToolUseCount":30,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":939,"cache_read_input_tokens":71420,"output_tokens":3523,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":939},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
